BattleManager: StateMachine
BattleState - BattleStart
Players: Array
Enemies: Array
PlayerPortrait: Array
BattleTextBox - (Autoscrolls during attacks) Leave last message active
BattleBar - Goes to level 10, starts on 3 if engaging, 0 if engaged, on 10 special attack appears


