Flow
Init
    Load up all necessary states
    Load up characters to portraits - Link by name?
    Load characters array
    Load enemies array
    Change to battle start 
BattleStart
    Enable fight or run ui
    * Fight -> change to player turn
    * Run -> throw player under the bus

PlayerTurn
    Play each player in order - show attack etc menu for each
    Attack - select an enemy and do the thing to enemy
    Skill - Open menu, choose skill, choose enemy/ally, execute
    Snack - Open menu, choose snack, choose ally, execute
    Toy - Let's not bother

After all players go, enemy turn
Enemy attacks player with whatever

Back to player turn




player menu node
 -> pass in player data
 -> pass in party items etc

attack -> pick a target
skill -> pick a skill -> pick a target



